    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>FeO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>FeO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.&nbsp;The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is _______</p>"
  },
